{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> The Gaon [Saadia] says that these too are Joshua's words. In my opinion they are Moses' words, and the witness is the verse after it: \"And it came to pass when he drew near to the camp\" (Exodus 19)." "<b>Faint.</b> A noun, like גבורה." "<b>Sound of singing.</b> Like נגינות, and this is \"they rose to play\" (Exodus 32:6)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:48.090885309Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}